# Story page: nm-hunt
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: The Pack
---
The Hunter came back, and it had brought its patience with it.

It was quicker now, and longer, and it did not stop to eat. {name} shed and shed and shed, until the grounds were littered with old selves.

'There is always something hungrier than you,' said the coil. I looked at the coil for a long time after that, and it looked back, and neither of us said anything.
